control: A provider call that does not answer within the provider timeout is the provider's failure
removes: a provider call has no deadline of the API server's, so a provider that does not answer holds the request
packages: ./api/app
tests: TestAProviderThatDoesNotAnswerIsTheProvidersFailure
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

